define('taoQtiItem/qtiCreator/widgets/states/Invalid',['jquery', 'taoQtiItem/qtiCreator/widgets/states/factory', 'tpl!taoQtiItem/qtiCreator/tpl/notifications/invalidInfoBox'], function ($, stateFactory, invalidInfoBoxTpl) {
  return stateFactory.create('invalid', ['sleep'], function (a) {
    this.widget.$container.addClass('invalid');
    this.$messageBox = $(invalidInfoBoxTpl({
      serial: this.widget.serial
    }));
    var $itemEditorBar = $('.item-editor-bar');
    $itemEditorBar.append(this.$messageBox);
  }, function () {
    this.widget.$container.removeClass('invalid');
    this.$messageBox.remove();
  });
});
